   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "",
     "dur": 0.6,
     "cam": "wide",
     "sfx": "om"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "She put away her jewels and silks, and wore bark and deerskin. She went to the very slope where Shiva had burned Kama.",
     "text_hi": "उन्होंने गहने और रेशम उतार दिए, और वल्कल और मृगचर्म पहन लिया। वे उसी ढलान पर गईं जहाँ शिव ने कामदेव को भस्म किया था।",
     "cam": "wide"
    },
    {
     "text": "",
     "dur": 1.0,
     "cam": "wide",
     "sfx": "fire",
     "tint": "#ff6a0a,0.12"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "In summer she sat between blazing fires under the burning sun.",
     "text_hi": "गर्मी में वे जलती धूप में धधकती अग्नियों के बीच बैठीं।",
     "cam": "wide",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    },
    {
     "text": "",
     "dur": 1.0,
     "cam": "wide",
     "sfx": "wind",
     "tint": "#a8c8f0,0.15"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "In winter she stood in icy water through the night.",
     "text_hi": "सर्दी में वे रात भर बर्फ़ीले पानी में खड़ी रहीं।",
     "cam": "wide",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "First she ate fruit. Then only leaves. Then she gave up even leaves. So the world called her Aparna, the one without even a leaf.",
     "text_hi": "पहले उन्होंने फल खाए। फिर केवल पत्ते। फिर पत्ते भी छोड़ दिए। तब संसार ने उन्हें अपर्णा कहा, जिसने पत्ता भी नहीं खाया।",
     "camMove": true,
     "cam": "full:parvati"
    },
    {
     "text": "",
     "dur": 1.2,
     "cam": "wide",
     "sfx": "swell"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Her tapas burned so fiercely that the three worlds grew hot, and the gods ran to Shiva.",
     "text_hi": "उनका तप इतना प्रचंड था कि तीनों लोक तपने लगे, और देवता दौड़कर शिव के पास गए।",
     "cam": "wide",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    }
   ],
